{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "86144d35-7a44-50d0-89ae-16e3b50beacf", "source_ordinal": 2958, "reading_ordinal": 1095, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "性侵危机", "published_at": "2021-11-09T02:19:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/497392694/answer/2213860184"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "得出这个结论所采用的估计算法具体是什么内容？谁来提供一个详情链接？结论建议先放放，先确认一下得出结论的具体方法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "毕竟，这各大媒体和NGO也在“估计”我们囚禁了几百万新疆人。ta们还“估计”过萨达姆在制造大规模杀伤性武器。在看到具体算法之前，建议先不要因为这种通稿过于激动。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "至于说原问题问的这些内容——似乎并没有什么法律规定如果有证据证明神职人员犯罪，ta们有可以免于刑事起诉和刑法的特权。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果警方找得足证据，起诉成功，大主教也要坐牢。这个无论是从各国的法律，还是从教会自己的法律，都没有什么特别的异议。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不过，这里补充一个信息给你们——", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "在性侵案问题上，争论问题的真正焦点，其实不是教会中有多少神职人员有犯罪行为——这一点主要是单纯朴素的老百姓很敏感。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而是一个更复杂的问题——教会不肯开放机密资料供调查使用，形成了包庇性侵者的机构责任。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果教会肯开放这些资料，那么具体犯罪人的问题就只是具体犯罪人的问题，教会本身不受指责。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "批评“罗马教会必然是在知情的前提下故意纵容”，其实主要的依据也在这里——人们普遍相信犯事的神职人员肯定有在告解中向自己的忏悔神父透露过这些事情的记录。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "看似教会性侵案数量惊人，其实说句坦白的——在西方，和数量惊人的学校性侵感、政府机关性侵案、体育界性侵案、娱乐界性侵案、企业机构性侵案、乃至军队性侵案……相比，实属一般。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 579}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "问题在于，如果是性侵案发生在企业，企业一般会三下五除二积极配合调查。发生在政府机关，也许阻力大一点，但是也自有其政敌摇旗呐喊，帮忙开绿灯。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但是教会却咬定青山不放松，始终不松口开放机密资料。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那么天主教会为什么不放聪明点，开放了算了呢？开放了不就没事了？", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "举一个类似的例子，你们立刻能懂——苹果也曾经拒绝配合FBI解锁犯罪嫌疑人的手机。库克宁可被罚款，宁可被人批评包庇犯罪，也绝不同意配合。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 775}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "为什么？你们明白了吗？", "char_start": 776, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "教会的这些内部资料，尤其是信众的忏悔内容——包括神职的忏悔内容在内——如果公开的向警方开放，你们想想这会导致其信众多大的疑虑。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 851}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你们自己不也每天在反对司法部门直接查阅你的邮件和通信记录吗？你的邮件记录、聊天记录的敏感性，可以和你跟心理医师说的话相比较吗？", "char_start": 852, "char_end": 915}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "如果一个心理医师对警方 / 你的父母 / 配偶 非常配合，你还找ta谈吗？你还会说出你所有的心结吗？如果你不会说，那么这个心理医师对你还有意义吗？", "char_start": 916, "char_end": 989}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而人向自己的神父所做的忏悔，其敏感性要超过你对学校心理老师说出来的万倍。", "char_start": 990, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果罗马教会打破这种性命相托的信任，它对其信众的影响力必定大减。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1059}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "苹果大不大？在一千六百年历史的天主教会面前只不过是侏儒和蝼蚁。苹果不肯帮FBI解锁用户手机的意愿值是1的话，天主教会不肯向调查机构开放机密资料的意愿值就是10000。", "char_start": 1060, "char_end": 1143}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "就这一条，对天主教会就是一个大僵局。", "char_start": 1144, "char_end": 1162}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而它成了一个绝佳的题材。", "char_start": 1163, "char_end": 1175}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你不公开资料，那可就别怪人不客气了——今天采访两个，明天刊登两个。这都是最敏感的案件，充满了大众传媒最渴望的看点，传播性十足。", "char_start": 1176, "char_end": 1239}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "各种“科学估计”类的研究可以尽情的出，光是稿费、访谈节目出场费也能值回成本了。", "char_start": 1240, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这类“科学论文”到了一个什么样的程度呢？", "char_start": 1281, "char_end": 1301}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "给你们看一个例子——", "char_start": 1302, "char_end": 1312}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "Clergy Sexual Abuse", "char_start": 1313, "char_end": 1332}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "稍微摘抄一下：", "char_start": 1332, "char_end": 1339}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "quote", "index": 30, "text": "It is commonly believed that clergy sexual abuse is an exclusively Catholic problem that does not happen in other churches. In a 1983 doctoral thesis by Richard Blackmon, 12% of the 300 Protestant clergy surveyed admitted to sexual intercourse with a parishioner and 38% admitted to other sexualized ", "char_start": 1340, "char_end": 1848, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "所以，真正熟悉这个议题的人，早就对“惊人的数字”脱敏了——1996年就有人搞出“77%遭遇性骚扰”的比例了，你算算那是几个亿？", "char_start": 1849, "char_end": 1912}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "现在的数字都算是“回归理性”了。", "char_start": 1913, "char_end": 1929}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "某种意义上讲，基督教性丑闻问题——乃至于宗教（包括佛教、印度教这些）性丑闻问题——并不是一个单纯的性丑闻问题。而是由性侵犯的具体事实、宗教影响力卷入政治斗争的恶习和天主教的告解实践三个因素一起催化出来的完美风暴。", "char_start": 1931, "char_end": 2037}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这些教会在政治上过于活跃，以至于总会有对手会出选举的考量，有强烈的动机要打击ta们的权威性和影响力。而要攻击对手的教会基本盘，最容易使用的手段就是教会性丑闻。", "char_start": 2038, "char_end": 2117}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "基督教会总忍不住要在政治中选边站，一会儿要endorse这个，一会儿要favor那个。既然如此，当然就不能怪对此有所警惕和戒惧的人要先备好弹药，以备某些主教牧师不识相，不撑我倒要撑对手。", "char_start": 2118, "char_end": 2211}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这是一类。", "char_start": 2213, "char_end": 2218}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "某国选举，某个被某教会支持的候选人却不讨某大国的喜欢，那么到了应景的时候，支持你的教会就要及时爆一点丑闻了。", "char_start": 2219, "char_end": 2273}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这是另一类。", "char_start": 2274, "char_end": 2280}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你有左右政局的能量，而且你也有这么做过的恶迹，那么你就要食得盐、抵得渴——请为这份权势承担对应的代价。", "char_start": 2281, "char_end": 2332}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "而对天主教，还额外有“告解”这个特别致命的命门，不被揪住这个“公开告解内容”的要害，几乎是不可能的。", "char_start": 2333, "char_end": 2383}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "人能不能代替神听人的告解，能不能代替神赦罪，这本来就是争议很大的问题。你要是敢这么做，你当然会获得极强的对信徒的影响力，但是在逻辑上就一定会同时带来这个躲不过的命门——你一定会对必不可少的性侵案有无法推诿的包庇的逻辑。几十万神职人员、几十亿信众，没有性丑闻根本就是办不到的。一旦有了，你不配合公开关键资料，你注定有包庇嫌疑。", "char_start": 2384, "char_end": 2546}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "要么，你就抱着你的忏悔神权，但同时扛住包庇罪，看看最终世人能不能原谅你，要么你就要放弃这一信仰利器，接受重大打击，但可以解除这个弱点。", "char_start": 2547, "char_end": 2614}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这两样，你要选一样。", "char_start": 2615, "char_end": 2625}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "要不要真正的退出对社会的直接干预，要不要放弃忏悔的保密性，这才是这才是天主教会性侵危机的真正大门槛。", "char_start": 2626, "char_end": 2676}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "如果你肯从此对一切政治保持中立，那么这类“研究”和“报道”自然会失去不少资助。", "char_start": 2677, "char_end": 2716}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "但你们查一查，基督教民主党有多少个？默克尔、马克宏、甚至勒庞的党的主张是什么？它们是些什么党？", "char_start": 2717, "char_end": 2764}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "哪有这么容易放下？", "char_start": 2765, "char_end": 2774}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "如果你肯放弃忏悔的保密性，那么问题就会从“机构系统性犯罪”变成“个别人的个人行为”。", "char_start": 2775, "char_end": 2817}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "但是你想一想这至关重要的核心教义，存续了一千六百年，哪有这么容易放弃？", "char_start": 2818, "char_end": 2853}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "坦率地讲，宗教领袖们恐怕更可能选择承认自己领导不力、管理失职，自请下台谢罪，宁肯“加强管理”，也难以迈过这两个真正解决问题的门槛。", "char_start": 2854, "char_end": 2919}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "而你不迈过这两个门槛，可以说无论你怎么“加强管理”，哪怕给每一个神职都戴上追踪器、在每一个礼拜堂里装上摄像头，也不可能真的阻止这类“大新闻”隔三差五的上头条。", "char_start": 2920, "char_end": 2999}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "解决不了问题——因为它一开始就不是单纯的性犯罪问题。", "char_start": 3000, "char_end": 3026}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "那就跟问题不出在这个西瓜不够熟一样。", "char_start": 3027, "char_end": 3045}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "坦白说，我个人对这个问题没什么特别立场——因为“教会是洁白无瑕的圣地，神职都是发着白光的天使”本来就是无知者的想象，根本就没有“维护这样的形象不打破”的必要。", "char_start": 3047, "char_end": 3126}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "并且我个人并不倾向赞同“人可以代表神听别人忏悔、可以代神赦罪”这个看法——当然，我也不会绝对确定这不合理。", "char_start": 3127, "char_end": 3180}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "这不是人类可以自己计算一番来证明可以或者不可以的那种议题。", "char_start": 3181, "char_end": 3210}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "如过一定要说这类问题有什么办法产生一个什么结果，那么只能是各执一端，等待历史来给出最终回答。", "char_start": 3211, "char_end": 3257}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "某种意义上讲，可以说性侵丑闻危机本身就是历史在对“教会可不可以干政”和“人能不能听人忏悔、代神赦罪”给出回答的一种形式。", "char_start": 3258, "char_end": 3318}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "但要等到尘埃落定，进入下一个稳态，才知道历史到底想说的是什么。", "char_start": 3319, "char_end": 3350}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-11/08/44f0c9d58fb99a7148d39df84b5a5f82.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-11/08/e65e71064cbddc06c24e901e2298a4aa.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 63, "quote": 1, "image": 2}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 1313, "sample": "Clergy Sexual Abuse"}]}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：法国天主教会承认性侵 21.6 万儿童，主教团主席下跪忏悔，教会需承担哪些责任？如何避免类似事件发生？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059"], "summary": "围绕“性侵危机”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“得出这个结论所采用的估计算法具体是什么内容？谁来提供一个详情链接？结论建议先放放，先确认一下得出结论的具体方法。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "得出这个结论所采用的估计算法具体是什么内容？谁来提供一个详情链接？结论建议先放放，先确认一下得出结论的具体方法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "84ba987e-16f2-529f-9276-1e20ef628e1e", "source_ordinal": 2957, "reading_ordinal": 1096, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "元宇宙", "published_at": "2021-11-09T16:05:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/496880204/answer/2214769695"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "真实世界的规则谁说了也不算，归自然规律说了算。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "元宇宙的规则谁说了算？扎克说了算还是小管家们说了算？元宇宙是否不受各国长臂管辖的影响？", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "最终是不是由一群人来掌握元宇宙的最高秩序？", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果是的话，掌握这些元宇宙最高秩序的人类也就是这些元宇宙里的神。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "VR、AR、MR技术不是假的，但是这跟元宇宙几乎没有关系。这些问题能解决，即使只有文字也可以构造世界。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而这些“人神”们在如何创造自己的元宇宙呢？——因为毫无头绪，ta们基本上打算照抄现实的宇宙，然后盘算着出于“性能优化”、“商业价值”、“道德原则”等考量去做一些“修正”和“改良”。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题是，这是在“修正”还是在“修偏”？是在“改良”还是在“改劣”？", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果“创世神”的能力太差，ta们所创造的世界自然也走不远。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 329}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待刘慈欣说「扎克伯格的元宇宙不是未来，元宇宙最后将引人类走向死路」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“元宇宙”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“真实世界的规则谁说了也不算，归自然规律说了算。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "真实世界的规则谁说了也不算，归自然规律说了算。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e4b84f2f-dd8c-5163-a062-003fd1ec871f", "source_ordinal": 2956, "reading_ordinal": 1097, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "善良程度", "published_at": "2021-11-11T05:19:03+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/495412788/answer/2217379057"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "以后这个问题啊，这样看——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "善良程度就像温度。“0摄氏度”并不是“啥也没有”，-273.15摄氏度才是真正的最低点，但是你遇不到-273.15度。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所以，“绝对不善良”的人是不存在的。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以，你再怎么相信“每个人的内心都是善良的”，都不可能是错的，也不可能“过分”。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那么为什么“过度信任每个人都是善良的”会成为一个问题？", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为有一种愚蠢的“相信善良观”——“你相信我是善良的，你就不可以对我设防；你对我设防，你就是不相信我是善良的”。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "按这种“相信观”，相信善良和不设防要绝对挂钩，越“相信”，你就有诚信上的义务越不设防。你如果设防，你相信别人的善良就是假的、骗人的。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "呵呵。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "用这种理论来质疑人对自己善良的相信的人，有一个算一个，有多远离多远。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你不是完美的神，你是个会喝醉、会冲动、会误解、会误判、会恐惧、会猜疑、会迷茫的人类。你对这一点心知肚明，你却不准别人设防，你这说得过去吗？", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不允许人对自己设防，是最大的不善良之一。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我相信你的善良，第一条就是相信你有“能体谅我的设防”这种最基本的善良。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你如果没有这一条，你的善良低于0摄氏度。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不是绝对没有，但是不及格。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为体谅、尊重和接受别人为了一切可能的安全顾虑而设防，是善良的及格线。", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人家在自己的权界以内设防，对人家自己更安全，是对你不方便。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你的善良如果不能超过“为了对方的安全，可以接受自己在对方权界以内的不方便”这个标准线，那么你的善良不及格。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你仍然可能乐于助人、仍然可能信守契约、仍然可能扶危济穷。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 636}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但是没这一条，你的善良就不及格。", "char_start": 637, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "相信人的善良，从相信人一定善良到了能尊重你的设防措施开始。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "然后该设防就设防，把所有没有善良到这一级、要拿“你相信我的善良就不要对我设防”来说事的人都直接淘汰。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "从这条线开始，哪里还有什么“过分相信人的善良”？", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 759}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：过分信任每个人内心都是善良的，长此以往，容易出现什么样的问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“善良程度”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“以后这个问题啊，这样看——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "以后这个问题啊，这样看——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c06153e9-8335-5313-b906-2fa86e4f86db", "source_ordinal": 2955, "reading_ordinal": 1098, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "钱和暴力的问题", "published_at": "2021-11-12T12:29:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/496970228/answer/2219608585"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人反驳这个都会用“钱不能让人复活，暴力不能让时光倒流”这类说法，这是没用的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为这些不光是钱和暴力解决不了，而是啥也解决不了。啥也解决不了的问题，自动转化为“你如何心平气和的接受它”的问题，而钱和暴力显然有助于解决这个接受度问题，结果还是它们赢。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "正确的答案，是金钱和暴力可以解决其他的问题，但解决不了它们自身的问题。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "也就是它们自己的成本问题。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这成本分两块，一块是获得它们的成本，一块是维持它们的成本。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "获得它们的成本就不说了——钱要赚，赚钱不容易；暴力要训练、要营养、要买装备……正所谓穷文富武，暴力的获得成本很不低。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而维持成本就大了去了——", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "金钱积累得多，保镖要请一堆，上下结交，年节打点都少不了，还要防盗防骗……着实不轻松。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "暴力则要防备人暗算、突袭、埋伏、陷害、趁火打劫等等等等种种敌意复仇。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这些都是成本。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "可以这么说——这些成本本身就意味着金钱和暴力不能乱用，用得不好，你用金钱和暴力所解决的问题的利润还不够支付它们的成本，久而久之，金钱就消失了，暴力也破产了。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "金钱和暴力可以解决很多别的问题，但问题是它们本身就是一个很困难的、不能单纯依靠金钱和暴力解决的问题。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你要先解决“如何在没有金钱和暴力的前提下，获得金钱和暴力优势”的问题，然后才能用金钱和暴力去解决它们能解决的问题。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这包括你直接继承了大量的金钱、直接遗传了暴力的本钱这两种情况——这看似解决了从无到有的第一桶金的问题，但是你如果学不会有净利润的运营方法，你这点本钱也会迅速亏光。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "举个例子，你去打架，你得学会如何越打朋友越多，而且朋友增长的数量要超过仇人增长的数量。否则你打不了几架就会被仇人联手打成猪头。那样你的暴力何止没有解决问题，它本身就制造了问题。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你去花钱解决问题，你要越解决钱越多才行。不然你三解决五解决，迟早把钱花光，你自己难道不吃饭、不花钱了？", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 775}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那么，问题来了——如何越打朋友越多？如何越花钱越多？", "char_start": 776, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这才是真的钱和暴力无法解决的问题。", "char_start": 803, "char_end": 820}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子至少两次跟我说「妈妈，金钱和暴力可以解决一切问题」，应该怎么引导？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“钱和暴力的问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人反驳这个都会用“钱不能让人复活，暴力不能让时光倒流”这类说法，这是没用的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人反驳这个都会用“钱不能让人复活，暴力不能让时光倒流”这类说法，这是没用的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a8f53ce5-eb79-5fc4-b117-3b514c800b5e", "source_ordinal": 2954, "reading_ordinal": 1099, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自爱", "published_at": "2021-11-14T07:41:28+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/23387667/answer/2222362783"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "以后你遇到“爱”这个字，直接换算成“为之争取最大程度的自由”就行。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "爱自己，就是为自己争取最大程度的自由，就是这样。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "多赚钱，于是你有更多的选择余地，这就算爱自己；", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "多锻炼身体，于是你活得更长，生命更多可能性，这就算爱自己；", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "多交朋友，于是你有更多人帮忙，这也算爱自己；", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "多学东西，于是你能力更强，能做到的事情也更多，这也算爱自己。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "凡是能放进这个圈圈里的，都是爱自己。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "但满足自己的欲望、自我宠溺却不见得是。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "自己老老实实的把那些所谓的“爱自己”一条条列出来，看看有几条不算是自我宠溺？", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "十条里有一条没有？", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "“宠爱”是一种奴役。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "渴望被宠爱本身已经够发育不良了，没人宠就歪眉皱眼、哭天抢地，甚至发展到咬牙切齿的自己来，这是一种欲为宠物而不可得的可耻状态。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "宠物不是人。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 338}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何才能做到爱自己？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“自爱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“以后你遇到“爱”这个字，直接换算成“为之争取最大程度的自由”就行。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "以后你遇到“爱”这个字，直接换算成“为之争取最大程度的自由”就行。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "86644dee-d70d-54e8-bac5-cddb4ed8116d", "source_ordinal": 2953, "reading_ordinal": 1100, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "人间失格", "published_at": "2021-11-17T23:26:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/446093570/answer/2229225380"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "老实说，反宗教、反神学也可以作为一种有意义的人生追求。三百六十行，行行出状元嘛。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但是，任何不想最后变成一场空的努力，都有一个基本的原则，就是绝不能自甘下流。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个下流，不是指“对女性搞猥亵”，而是指水平低下、粗制滥造、假冒伪劣。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“自甘下流”，就是常年满足低水平的劣质玩意儿，仿佛不是人类，没有正常的对无限低级重复的厌倦。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "像实验小鼠或者鸽子一样，按一下按钮、出一颗谷子、好高兴；又按一下按钮、又出颗谷子、又好高兴。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "按一万次按钮、吃了一万颗谷子、高兴了一万次。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是放弃了身为人的格。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "放弃了“人格”，你懂不懂？", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "干这种事，你会以超乎你想象的速度和广度失去人对你的尊重。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你都难以理解为什么别人都不把你当回事，既不尊重你的意见，也不考虑你的利益，你会整天纳闷、苦恼、纠结、愤怒为什么人人都“欺负你”。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为你自己为了一点可悲的快感廉价的卖了自己的人格。你在别人的眼里，在精神上是半透明的。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "人家不是不尊重你的意见，而是只要以任何神秘的直觉发现了你有自甘下流的习惯，就会开始无意识的根本看不见你的意见。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人会本能的意识到在你身上投入任何的物质、关注、情感、智力资源，最后都是一场空。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "轮到你发言，人家全体自动转入“没啥新鲜的、也没啥重要的”模式。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你第二天质问对方为啥你昨天在会上说了啥啥啥你怎么当没听见。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人家会找一圈人作证你没说过。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "最可悲的，是ta找的这一圈人都表示“记不清”——那只是看你脸色、照顾你的情绪说记不清，免得你发急平白跟你结仇。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "实际上人家就是全体不记得。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 641}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不记得啊，真的没印象啊，算不尊重你吗？难道你还能不许人记性不好？", "char_start": 642, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "算不尊重你吗？", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "heading", "index": 21, "text": "算吗？", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 686}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "看明白这个过程没有？", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "并不需要别人专门对你不尊重，你就会失去人的尊重。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 722}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "记住了，任何健康运转社会都会自然而然的把自甘下流的人渐渐排到资源分配的尾端去。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你应该对低级的东西敏感，最多只吃一次亏，上一次当，过一次上一台阶，而不是过一次在变着方再来一次。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你不应该长期满足于这类思想的劣质货，满足于这类愚昧的廉价“胜利”。你要是满足了，这类所谓的“胜利”就会成为你的精神坟墓。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "二十来岁，就已经死了，埋了，真的是可悲。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这类对宗教神学的反反复复的低级“批判”，就是这种“下流”之一。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "希望这个答案是你最后一次踏进这烂泥坑。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 946}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你再不出去，对你就不是什么宗教合不合理的问题了——这问题离你十万八千里远——而是你要怎么对得起你自己的生命的问题了。", "char_start": 947, "char_end": 1005}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "不要自误。", "char_start": 1006, "char_end": 1011}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "“能”是什么意思？", "char_start": 1013, "char_end": 1022}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "就是你办不到的，人家办得到，这就叫“能”", "char_start": 1023, "char_end": 1043}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "“全能”是什么意思？", "char_start": 1044, "char_end": 1054}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "意思是你觉得办不到的任何一件事，ta都办得到。", "char_start": 1055, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你连想都没想过的事，ta也都办得到。", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1097}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "所以啊，拿这“矛盾”那“矛盾”来为难上帝的人，纯属逻辑没学好。", "char_start": 1098, "char_end": 1129}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "为全知全能辩护是轻而易举的。", "char_start": 1131, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你能举出任何一种可行的做法，你就算辩护成功。", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1168}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你就是一条都举不出来，你仍然不会算辩论失败——你一介凡人想不到办法而已，根本不表示上帝就会因此没办法。", "char_start": 1169, "char_end": 1220}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "难道蚂蚁想不到怎么可以过河，就代表人类也会一筹莫展？", "char_start": 1221, "char_end": 1247}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "尝试用“逻辑证明”来“批判”一神论，是一种逻辑显然的没有意义的无用功。", "char_start": 1248, "char_end": 1283}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "连永动机都比这有希望，这个是一开始就被阉割干净了，你只有失败一种可能性，赢是不可能的。", "char_start": 1284, "char_end": 1327}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "善恶怎么分？是看是否符合孔夫子的话吗？那孔夫子是听谁的？所谓听周公的？周公听谁的？这是个祭祖比赛？谁死的早谁代表真理？", "char_start": 1329, "char_end": 1388}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "善恶还是要看跟从哪一个结论人类能延续多久吧？", "char_start": 1389, "char_end": 1411}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "那么假设你跟全知全能者面对面站在一起，争论一个行为到底是善还是恶，你说这事发生人类会少存在一百年，全知全能的这位说你错了，这事发生人类历史可以延长一百年。", "char_start": 1412, "char_end": 1489}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "你自己掂量一下，逻辑上谁更有可能对？", "char_start": 1490, "char_end": 1508}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "老实说，如果你站在一神论的立场上，你很容易猜到这个问题的基本逻辑通路。", "char_start": 1509, "char_end": 1544}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "问题并不出在神眼里的善恶跟我们人类有多么大的原则差别。", "char_start": 1545, "char_end": 1572}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "人类的道德本身就是通过自然历史的过程在塑造人类时同时写入人类的意识底层的。", "char_start": 1573, "char_end": 1610}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "在神学上可以这么说——人类的道德体系本身就是一个发育期期的神的道德体系，两者是指向一致的。", "char_start": 1611, "char_end": 1656}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "而且即使前者向后者发育的过程中有类似昆虫那样完全变态发育的现象，呈现出阶段性的“颠覆”现象。", "char_start": 1657, "char_end": 1703}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "但在内在核心上始终是一致的。", "char_start": 1704, "char_end": 1718}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "甚至是同一的。", "char_start": 1719, "char_end": 1726}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "问题是，一神论的神，作为算力无限的全知全能者，算得失是把斗争双方的利益合并起来算，而且算进一切自知和不自知的旁观者的利益，一直算到时间尽头。", "char_start": 1727, "char_end": 1797}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "每时每刻，实时运算，从时间源头，直到时间尽头。", "char_start": 1798, "char_end": 1821}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "所以根据同一的道德原则，算出来的结果很不见得和人类的结论一样罢了。", "char_start": 1822, "char_end": 1855}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "这篇东西，根本不是为了说神学。", "char_start": 1857, "char_end": 1872}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "说的是是，说的就是你。", "char_start": 1873, "char_end": 1884}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "为什么这存在了不知几百年、这么容易想到、查到的答案，你在2021年这种信息爆炸的年代，已经活了二十年，受了高等教育，居然自己没有想到，自己没有查到，会需要别人来告诉你？", "char_start": 1885, "char_end": 1969}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "你有没有拿这个问题去“为难”人取乐？", "char_start": 1970, "char_end": 1988}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "你有没有一个又一个的刷那些无限重复、只是在换花样秀“口才”的答案享受“优越感”？", "char_start": 1989, "char_end": 2029}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "如果有，你的问题绝对不是“宗教”。", "char_start": 2030, "char_end": 2047}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "马上改，救救你自己。", "char_start": 2049, "char_end": 2059}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 71, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：上帝全善与上帝全能是否矛盾?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064"], "summary": "围绕“人间失格”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“老实说，反宗教、反神学也可以作为一种有意义的人生追求。三百六十行，行行出状元嘛。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "老实说，反宗教、反神学也可以作为一种有意义的人生追求。三百六十行，行行出状元嘛。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "15dce3b4-0a90-586c-88c0-df18b4afba6b", "source_ordinal": 2952, "reading_ordinal": 1101, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "抗寒", "published_at": "2021-11-18T00:44:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/421924384/answer/2229312166"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人类“抗寒”就一招——加快新陈代谢，内脏发热。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "炉子里多添柴，什么“寒”都能抗。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那是柴的功劳，不是炉子的功劳。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "把超级“不能抗寒”的学生仔丢进大东北，ta觉得冷，就要抖，抖了就要饿，饿了就要吃。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只要有得吃，管快管够管饱，ta也能抗寒。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "没衣服、没暖气、也没食物，能在相同低温下维持超出一般水平的生存时间，这才叫抗寒。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不敢冬泳、不爱在冬天穿薄点，这个叫怕寒。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "语文搞错，万事皆休。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 192}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：去法国的时候我发现法国学生很抗寒，为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“抗寒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人类“抗寒”就一招——加快新陈代谢，内脏发热。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人类“抗寒”就一招——加快新陈代谢，内脏发热。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d418db03-2fe4-5993-9de1-04238c444316", "source_ordinal": 2951, "reading_ordinal": 1102, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "应该不应该", "published_at": "2021-11-19T11:20:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20368978/answer/2231674357"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "所谓的“应该”，总是意味着这背后存在着某种价值。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "对你存在价值，那么对你而言就可以说“应该”；你计算出对对方存在价值，你就可以对对方说“（我觉得）你应该”；你计算出对双方都有价值，你就可以说“（我觉得）我们/大家应该”。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果没有这个计算出的预期价值作为“应该”的前提，“应该”就是一种纯粹的统治和奴役，是一种单纯的人对人的压迫和剥夺。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "下次任何人跟你说“应该”，你都可以询问ta为你计算出来的对你的价值是什么——当然，你要做得聪明一点，可以问ta“为什么应该”，不要问“这对我有什么好处”。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对方要是说“这就是天经地义”“大家都这么做”“这还有什么为什么”……这说明对方自己没活醒，其建议可以忽略，其意见仅以其制造麻烦的能力为考虑的权重。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "对方要是说“因为规定如此”，那么这意思是顺从的价值来自“规定者”的不惩罚，ta只是转告而已。那么问一下规定者是谁、规定的惩罚是什么，你好独自核查一下，以防对方转达有误。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现在问题来了，谈论自杀者应不应该受谴责，参与这个讨论的是哪几个人？", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "谴责自杀者，如果对你有价值，这价值是什么？", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你觉得对我有价值，那么这价值是什么？", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果对自杀者——包括意图自杀者——有价值，那么这价值是什么？", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你要谈论这问题，就要一一回答这些疑问。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你要注意，你回答一个，只解决了一个应该，这并不等于自动也解决了别的应该。对你有价值，不表示对我有价值；对你我有价值，不表示对ta有价值。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "对全世界所有人都有价值，唯独对某一个人没价值，对这个人而言，也不成其为“应该”。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这时候，就怕所有的人一拥而上，来个“你应该，因为如果你不‘应该’，我们就会叫你明白明白为啥你‘应该’”。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人为什么自杀？", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "就为了让这种四面围堵的“应该”无效。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "heading", "index": 17, "text": "听好了，其实它本来就无效。", "char_start": 726, "char_end": 739}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0176"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：自杀者应该受到谴责吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“应该不应该”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“所谓的“应该”，总是意味着这背后存在着某种价值。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "所谓的“应该”，总是意味着这背后存在着某种价值。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
